        "text": "=Generate a detailed test plan from the following PRD document:\n\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nCreate a comprehensive test plan in markdown format that includes:\n- Test objectives\n- Scope and requirements\n- Test strategy\n- Test cases with scenarios\n- Edge cases and boundary conditions\n- Risk analysis",
